From 340c4f9f424842ce4884cedd0aa1c708df45a05d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Craterbrain <58347640+Craterbrain@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 21:18:16 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PlaitOS: Contacts in the unified style

Palette from the system's wallpaper tones (day and night), tonal avatar colours, contact-card sections as 16 dp tonal cards without a
shadow, section titles in the app accent instead of a colour taken from the contact's photo (unreadable on dark photos).
versionCode 10736 so it installs as an update while iterating.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
